    ["The \"Red Gloves\" have an emergency mission, and I need to leave for a few days.\nBlackthorn Security Company is where Mr. Fool's extraordinary journey began. Whether you want to learn more about Mr. Fool or start your own extraordinary story, becoming a member of the Nighthawks squad here is a good choice. Frye is a trustworthy captain. Finally, keep the gold coin left by Mr. Fool safe."] = "The \"Red Gloves\" have an emergency mission, and I need to leave for a few days.\nBlackthorn Security Company is where Mr. Fool's extraordinary journey began. Whether you want to learn more about Mr. Fool or start your own extraordinary story, becoming a member of the Ночные Ястребы squad here is a good choice. Frye is a trustworthy captain. Finally, keep the gold coin left by Mr. Fool safe.",
    ["Last night, an explosion and riot broke out at a factory in the West District. The police claimed it was a \"suspected gas leak\" and have cordoned off the scene. However, witnesses claimed to have seen multiple strange figures appearing above the factory, moving at eerie, high speeds. Experts explained that these figures were merely distorted projections of the explosion's dust, and citizens need not panic."] = "Вчера вечером на заводе в Западном округе вспыхнул взрыв и беспорядки. Полиция заявила, что это «подозрение на утечку газа», и оцепила место происшествия. Однако свидетели утверждали, что видели несколько странных фигур, появившихся над фабрикой и двигавшихся с жуткой, высокой скоростью. Эксперты пояснили, что эти цифры являются лишь искаженными проекциями пыли от взрыва, и гражданам не следует паниковать.",
